<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Bielatal rock-and-ruin circuit — Complete operator rock-and-ruin circuit</name><desc>From Hochofen/Brausenstein, walk via Bertablick, Kleine Bastei and Gedächtnishain through the Rosengarten to Kaiser-Wilhelm-Feste and the Herkulessäulen rock passages. Continue past Großvaterstuhl and Ottomühle, then climb to Johanniswacht and Sachsenstein. The captured circuit includes the optional, more exposed Nachbar spur before returning on the Poststeig to the historic blast furnace. Route: Nicole Hesse / Tourismusverband Sächsische Schweiz — Bielatal: Durch die bizarre Felsenwelt mit vielen Aussichtspunkten (CC BY-SA 4.0). Source: https://www.saechsische-schweiz.de/wanderungen/aussichten-rosenthal-bielatal. Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/. The full route coordinate sequence is unchanged. Good Shit simplifies the display path and reformats the GPX.

